Founded in 1937, the School of Economics and Business Administration (SEBA) of Chongqing University has been accredited by AACSB, EQUIS, and AMBA, making it the 112th business school in the world to receive triple accreditations. SEBA invites applications for full-time positions at all levels and provides a competitive compensation package.
